### Create a poll with atomic choices
POST http://localhost:8001/polls
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Community Leader Election",
  "close_date": "2026-12-31T23:59:59Z",
  "choices": ["Alice", "Bob", "Carol"]
}

### Get poll details and choices
GET http://localhost:8001/polls/{{poll_id}}

### Cast a vote in a poll
POST http://localhost:8001/polls/{{poll_id}}/votes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "signature": "sig_voter_1",
  "choice_uuid": "{{choice_id}}"
}

### Get user's current (latest) vote for a poll
GET http://localhost:8001/polls/{{poll_id}}/votes/sig_voter_1

